{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-06_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-06","title":"手すりを握る","storyCode":"2-6","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"47fa8e25b76b30553a3b29c3e3605696e4f1433dd345f81ca618dac8921c0c1f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十八关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ？　ちょっと～！　もしかして、あたしの出番ナシ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"来るのが遅かったからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"何はともあれ、みなさんが無事で何よりです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"さあ、そろそろ行きましょうか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"東側の建物に向かって、そこから下へ降りていけば、レユニオンに私たちの位置を悟られずに済むはずです。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……もう、大丈夫……かな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そうですね……今のところは。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……顔色が悪いですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"ううん、平気……ちょっと、めまいがするだけだから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"このくらい……なんでもないよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そう、ですか。……ところで、話は変わりますが……ミーシャさんが龍門に来てから、どのくらいになりますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"大体、一週間くらい……かな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一週間……ですか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"うん。……前は、チェルノボーグにいたんだ。……でもある日、街に怖い人たちがやってきて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"何が何だかわからなかったけど、とにかく皆逃げ出して……私もそれで、逃げてきたの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"その人たちは、レユニオンの構成員ですね……レユニオンは、チェルノボーグの街を攻撃していましたから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"そう、だったんだ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたは……そうなる前から、感染者だったんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"どうだろう……わかんないや。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"でも……脚にこれが生えてきたのは、ここ数日のことなんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……それで、私……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ、う……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ミーシャさん？　ミーシャさん……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ッ、医療班をこちらへ！　急いでください！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["ミーシャ"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["テキサス"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["エクシア"]}]}
